## Brand assets — reserved

The visual identity is not licensed for reuse. This includes, but is
not limited to:

  - The color palette (Palm Springs-inspired teal, terracotta, cream,
    and related tokens defined in src/index.css and tailwind.config.ts)
  - Josefin Sans usage patterns (uppercase headings, wide letter-
    spacing, small-caps eyebrows)
  - The diagonal teal / terracotta split motif used in the hero,
    OG images, and favicon
  - Hero photography (src/assets/hero-palm-springs.jpg)
  - The favicon and derived icons (public/favicon.*,
    public/apple-touch-icon.png)
  - Generated Open Graph images (dist/og/*, output of
    scripts/generate-og-images.mjs)
  - The "ISABELLE ULFSDOTTER" wordmark and its typographic treatments

Please do not adapt or reproduce these for other sites.


